    "notes": [
      "Data directory: each run uses a disposable temporary directory (EDR_DATA_DIR) on local storage, removed afterwards; never a shared or existing data directory.",
      "Browser for PRJ-E2E and PRJ-A11Y: project-local Chromium under .cache/ms-playwright (git-ignored), downloaded by the test runner on first use; no host installation.",
      "Network: PRJ-INSTALL (npm ci) and PRJ-AUDIT (npm audit) need the npm registry; the first PRJ-E2E or PRJ-A11Y run needs the Playwright browser download host. No gate contacts a sports-data or AI provider.",
      "Long runs: on macOS keep the host awake during e2e and final gate runs (caffeinate -i; a closed lid or manual sleep still interrupts).",
      "Servers in gate runs bind 127.0.0.1 only: verification port 4310 (verify worktree), demo port 4320 (demo worktree, PO acceptance only).",
      "LIVE_DATA is optional and manual: the Product Owner places a free-plan FOOTBALL_DATA_API_TOKEN in .env.local (mode 0600) of the worktree that runs the probe (T53); no gate uses the token, test:live or probe:football-data (R-135, R-258)."
    ],
